Z||000000||72vinman||10-25-2001||11:46 PM||||I have recently upgraded my Internet Explorer to version 6. Ever since I have been having a lot of problems with file extensions. When ever I save a file to my computer it automatically converts the file to an executable .EXE <BR>I have also lost all my file extension relations. My computer does not know what program opens which extension. I have to go into each individual program and associate each program with it's proper extension. Does this sound wierd or is it just me?<BR>Please help. Thanks||||reg||1
